  speakerName: 
  lineText: "<u><b>Victim Details</b></u><u><b>Murder Details</b></u><u> <b>Autopsy
    & Medical Report</b> </u> | <b>VICTIM</b> |  |  |  | \r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Name:</b>
    Marcus Webb\r\n<b>Profession:</b> Curator & Owner \r\n<b>Age:</b> 34 yrs 2 mo\r\n<b>Blood
    Type:</b> AB+\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Time of Murder:</b> Between 10 PM and 12 PM last
    night.\r\n<b>Murder Weapon:</b> -<i>not confirmed</i>-\r\n<b>Official Precinct
    Theory:</b> Death by self-administered overdose of synthetic depressants leading
    to an accidental fatal fall, currently pushed by city council authority as a
    suicide triggered by impending bankruptcy.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Primary Cause of Death:</b>
    Blunt force trauma to head consistent with fatal fall.\r\n<b>Toxicology Screen:</b>
    Pending / Unverified.\r\n<b>Secondary Findings:</b> Synthetic depressant vial
    recovered from victim's left jacket pocket.\r\n<b>Notes:</b> Precinct narrative
    assumes fall induced by drug ingestion.\r\n\r"
